# {{ name }}

{{ description }}

Built with [Atlas](https://github.com/streats22/atlas-laravel).

## Install

```bash
composer require {{ name }}
php artisan {{ command }}:install     # imports the bundled pages, custom blocks and media
```

Re-run with `--force` to overwrite pages/blocks that already exist. Then open the Atlas editor (`/atlas`) to edit the imported pages.

## What's inside

* Developer blocks (`src/Blocks`) — registered automatically with Atlas.
* Block views (`resources/views/atlas`).
* A content bundle (`resources/atlas/bundle.json` + `media/`).
* Translations (`lang/`) — publish with `php artisan vendor:publish --tag={{ command }}-lang`.

## Requirements

PHP 8.3+, Laravel 12 or 13, `streats22/atlas`.

